  "name": "Example: \n                    Identifying Like Terms when there are No Like Terms",
  "problem": "List the like terms for the expression\n\n$$\n20 - 6a + 2b - 6c.\n$$",
  "worked_solution": "We write the terms of the expression as follows:\n\n$$\n(20) + (-6a) + (2b) + (-6c)\n$$\n\nNone of these terms have the same variable part. Consequently, there are no like terms in this expression.",
